    <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Tool</th><th>Characteristics</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td><strong>LightRAG</strong></td><td>Lightweight RAG combining graph and vectors. Strong at incremental updates (open source).</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Graphiti</strong></td><td>A knowledge graph framework that also captures time (change).</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>GraphRAG</strong> (Microsoft)</td><td>An approach that builds entities, relationships, and summaries from a body of documents.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
