<h3>The real issue is not search but "getting what is in your head out"</h3>
<p>The quality of a knowledge graph ultimately hinges on <strong>the amount and quality of the data you put in</strong>. Yet for many people the real bottleneck is not <strong>that the system cannot find things</strong>, but <strong>that the knowledge in their head has not gone into the system yet</strong>.</p>

